notes.body:
A table may or may not be populated based on the pass through the post-dissector.  
Trying to add an empty table gives warning - ok.  
![260420_lua_debug_watch_1](/uploads/64200bbce66cc77da2b152c75207fc3d/260420_lua_debug_watch_1.jpg){width=900 height=577}

Once the table it added for watch, on future passes it shows values even when table it empty.  
![260420_lua_debug_watch_2](/uploads/7cecfa2e1b6ca91efceaef26c2204074/260420_lua_debug_watch_2.jpg){width=900 height=577}

